MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=0
RELEASE_VERSION=1
PRERELEASE=1
DEV_VERSION=1
DESCRIPTION=Makefile: top-level builds default to -j1 (serial compile jobs) unless the user passes an explicit job count (-j/--jobs) or inherits a parallel jobserver; reduces out-of-memory kills from gcc on low-RAM hosts while keeping parallel builds one flag away.
